OL,3,GNEWSAACOTAR fans put real life on hold
OL,4,Afor latest release
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs I arrive at Waterstones in York
OL,7,Fshortly before 08:00, there is already
OL,8,Fa queue forming outside the bookshop.
OL,10,FFans of Sarah J Maas's bestselling A
OL,11,FCourt of Thorns and Roses (ACOTAR)
OL,12,Fseries are waiting eagerly to get their
OL,13,Fhands on the latest instalment.
OL,15,FAmong them is Olivia Bray, 28, who has
OL,16,Fspent more than a decade immersed in
OL,17,Fthe American author's fantasy world.
OL,19,FFor Bray, the appeal goes beyond magic,
OL,20,Fromance and fantastical kingdoms. It is
OL,21,Fthe feminism running through Maas's
OL,22,Fbooks that has kept her coming back.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
